{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">風暴期間，油麻地避風塘有內地貨船入水擱淺，水警到場救出三人，無人受傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發是在早上近五點半，九號信號生效期間，一艘內地貨船在油麻地避風塘，對開海面入水，在防波堤擱淺，並失去動力。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">水警輪出動，指揮貨船拋錨穩住船身，再協調救援拖船等，協助3名受困船員登上水警輪，返回岸上，無人受傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.VESSEL-2230.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026HfvQbLWekZ1785079739.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.VESSEL-2230.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-26T15:58:15.990575+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}